{"2721900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Card TD", "steam_appid": 2721900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "CardTD is a top down tower defense game, with a playful art style, and deckbuilding mechanics drawing inspiration from games like Dominion. <br><br>Unlike many card games players build their deck throughout the entirety of a level, purchasing the cards from an in level shop. However players can modify the card pool of this shop through ingame earned booster packs. Providing a lot of decision making and customization for players in how they will attack the challenges of each level.<br><br>Features!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four worlds to play through with diverse themes and gimmicks. <br></li><li>Nearly 90 different cards sorted into 9 distinct booster packs and 1 base set.<br></li><li>3 mechanically deep characters to spice up goals and gameplay.<br></li><li>7 unique towers with three different tiers apiece.<br></li><li>Hordes of unique and themed enemies for each world, with a boss for each world.<br></li><li>A progression system that allows players to play the game at their own pace.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "CardTD is a top down tower defense game, with a playful art style, and deckbuilding mechanics drawing inspiration from games like Dominion. <br><br>Unlike many card games players build their deck throughout the entirety of a level, purchasing the cards from an in level shop. However players can modify the card pool of this shop through ingame earned booster packs. Providing a lot of decision making and customization for players in how they will attack the challenges of each level.<br><br>Features!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four worlds to play through with diverse themes and gimmicks. <br></li><li>Nearly 90 different cards sorted into 9 distinct booster packs and 1 base set.<br></li><li>3 mechanically deep characters to spice up goals and gameplay.<br></li><li>7 unique towers with three differen